OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry through
OL,6,Fthe evening with increasing clear
OL,7,Fspells and light winds. Staying dry
OL,8,Fwith lengthy clear periods overnight.
OL,9,FA cold night with a slight frost in
OL,10,Fsheltered glens.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FDry but chilly start with
OL,13,Fsome brightness but cloud gradually
OL,14,Fspilling east in the morning. Rain
OL,15,Fspreads east through the afternoon and
OL,16,Fevening. Becoming windy with southerly
OL,17,Fcoastal gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
