OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and a few showers Friday and
OL,7,FSaturday, becoming frequent for a time
OL,8,FFriday night. Occasionally heavy rain
OL,9,Fspreads east on Sunday. Windy at times
OL,10,FFriday, and Saturday night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
